sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student (web UI)
    actor D as Admin (web UI)
    participant G as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant A as Auth
    participant T as Tutor
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notification

    Note over S,N: REST = solid arrow, gRPC = labelled "gRPC", event = labelled "AMQP", local DB step = note box

    rect rgb(255, 236, 236)
    Note over S,T: Phase 1 · Student drafts and submits the application
    S->>G: REST POST /api/profiles/me/tutor/drafts (Bearer token, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth: verify session, STUDENT capability
    A-->>G: signed actor assertion (60 s, RS256)
    G->>T: REST request + actor assertion + gateway credential
    Note over T: Local DB transaction (MongoDB tutor_db):<br/>save draft kind APPLICATION, state DRAFT
    T-->>S: 201 draft, ETag = revision
    S->>G: REST PUT /api/profiles/me/tutor/drafts/{id} (If-Match: bio, ID document URL, intro video URL)
    G->>T: REST (same forward-auth and actor assertion as steps 2 to 4)
    T-->>S: 200 updated draft
    S->>G: REST POST /api/profiles/me/tutor/drafts/{id}/submit (If-Match, consentAccepted)
    G->>T: REST (forward-auth and actor assertion)
    alt Complete application
        Note over T: One local transaction: draft becomes PENDING (immutable),<br/>outbox row tutor.submission-submitted for all admins
        T-->>S: 200 submission PENDING
    else Missing bio, ID document or video, or one already pending
        T-->>S: 422 VALIDATION_FAILED or 409 PENDING_SUBMISSION_EXISTS
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over D,T: Phase 2 · Admin reviews
    D->>G: REST POST /api/admin/tutor-requests/{id}/review (ADMIN capability, If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>T: REST (forward-auth and actor assertion)
    alt APPROVE for a first application
        Note over T: One local transaction: submission APPROVED, activation PENDING,<br/>grant work row saved, outbox row tutor.submission-decided
        T-->>D: 202 operation pending, statusUrl /api/operations/tutor/{id}
    else REJECT with a reason
        Note over T: One local transaction: submission REJECTED with reason,<br/>outbox row tutor.submission-decided
        T-->>D: 200 rejected, no tutor capability granted
    end
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over T,A: Phase 3 · Activation: Tutor asks Auth to grant the capability
    Note over T: Grant worker claims the pending grant, then calls Auth outside any DB transaction
    T->>A: gRPC GrantTutorCapability (stable operationId, user, submission, approval revision)
    Note over A: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL auth_db):<br/>add TUTOR to the account once, save tutor_grants row for this operationId
    alt Auth answers
        A-->>T: APPLIED (capability TUTOR)
        Note over T: One local transaction: activation ACTIVE, operation SUCCEEDED,<br/>outbox row tutor.activated
    else Auth unavailable or response lost
        Note over T: Grant stays PENDING, worker retries the same operationId with backoff.<br/>Auth returns the saved result, never a second grant
    end
    S->>G: REST GET /api/operations/tutor/{id}
    G->>T: REST (forward-auth and actor assertion)
    T-->>S: 200 SUCCEEDED (or PENDING until activation finishes)
    end

    rect rgb(243, 235, 255)
    Note over T,N: Phase 4 · Notify (asynchronous, after each commit)
    T-)Q: AMQP publish tutor.submission-submitted / submission-decided / activated (outbox worker)
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    Note over N: Dedupe event, create jobs: admins on submit,<br/>the applicant on decision and activation (simulated delivery)
    end
